{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x/y = 5/4 হয়, তবে (x + y)/(x - y) = ?", "option1": "ক) 8", "option2": "খ) 9", "option3": "গ) 1/8", "option4": "ঘ) 1/9", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x/y = 5/4<br />বা, (x + y)/(x - y) = (5 + 4)/(5 - 4)<br />বা,&nbsp;(x + y)/(x - y) = 9/1<br />&there4;&nbsp;(x + y)/(x - y) = 9</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) (y - 5)/(a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>) = (y - 7)(b<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>) হলে, y = ?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -5", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) 6", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>(y - 5)/(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- b<sup>2</sup>) = (y - 7)/(b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- a<sup>2</sup>)<br />বা,&nbsp;(y - 5)/(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- b<sup>2</sup>) = -(y - 7)/(a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>)<br />বা, y - 5 = -y + 7<br />বা, 2y = 12<br />&there4; y = 6<br /><br />প্রশ্নে ডান পক্ষে &divide; চিহ্নটি দেওয়া ছিলো না। তাই উত্তর বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>3</sup> - 9x + 10 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলগুলোর সমষ্টি কত?", "option1": "ক) -9", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 9", "option4": "ঘ) 1/9", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> - 9x + 10 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> - 0.x<sup>2</sup> - 9x + 10 = 0<br />সমীকরণে মূলগুলোর সমষ্টি = 0/1<br />= 0</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 2x<sup>2</sup> + mx + 4 = 0 সমীকরণের মূল দু'টি সমান হলে, m = ?", "option1": "ক) -4&radic;2", "option2": "খ) -4", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 4/(&radic;2)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>2x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ mx + 4 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয় সমান<br />&there4; নিশ্চায়ক = 0<br />বা, m<sup>2</sup> - 4.2.4 = 0<br />বা, m<sup>2</sup> = 32<br />&there4; m =&nbsp;&plusmn; 4&radic;2</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x + 6y = 16 এবং x = 2y হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) -4", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + 6y = 16<br />বা, 2y + 6y = 16 [যেহেতু, x = 2y]<br />বা, 8y = 16<br />বা, y = 2<br />&there4; x = 4</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 2/x = 8 এবং 3/y = 9 হলে, 1/(y - x) = ?", "option1": "ক) -12", "option2": "খ) 12", "option3": "গ) -(1/12)", "option4": "ঘ) 1/12", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>2/x = 8<br />বা, 2/8 = x<br />&there4; x = 1/4<br /><br />3/y = 9<br />বা, 3/9 = y<br />&there4; y = 1/3<br /><br />&there4; y - x <br />= 1/3 - 1/4<br />= (4 - 3)/12<br />= 1/12<br />&there4; 1/(y - x) = 12</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 4x + y = 9, 2x + y = -1 হলে, y = ?", "option1": "ক) -11", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 5", "option4": "ঘ) 11", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x + y = 9......(1)<br />2x + y = -1.....(2)<br />(1) নং&nbsp; থেকে (2) নং বিয়োগ করে পাই,<br />2x = 10<br />&there4; x = 5<br /><br />(2) নং থেকে<br />10 + y = -1<br />&there4; y = -11</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x + 1/x = 2 সমীকরণের মূলের প্রকৃতি-", "option1": "ক) বাস্তব ও সমান", "option2": "খ) মূলদ ও অসমান", "option3": "গ) অবাস্তব", "option4": "ঘ) অমূলদ ও সমান", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x + 1/x = 2<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 2x<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1 = 0<br />সমীকরণের নিশ্চায়ক = (-2)<sup>2</sup> - 4.1.1<br />= 4 - 4<br />= 0<br />&there4; সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয় বাস্তব ও সমান&nbsp;</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x - y = 7 এবং xy = 60 হলে, x = ?", "option1": "ক) -12", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 0", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x - y = 7<br />&there4; y = x - 7......(1)<br /><br />আবার, xy = 60<br />বা, x(x - 7) = 60 [y = x - 7 বসিয়ে]<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 7x - 60 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 12x + 5x - 60 = 0<br />বা, x(x - 12) + 5(x - 12) = 0<br />বা, (x - 12)(x + 5) = 0<br />&there4; x = -5, 12</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) a<sup>3</sup>x<sup>2</sup> + a<sup>4</sup>x + a = 0 সমীকরণের x চলক হিসাবে বিবেচিত হলে সমীকরণের ঘাত কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>সমীকরণের x এর সর্বোচ্চ ঘাত 2; সুতরাং সমীকরণের ঘাত 2।</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) AC &gt; BC এবং C &lt; 0 হলে কোনটি সত্য?", "option1": "ক) A - B &gt; 0", "option2": "খ) 1/A &gt; 1/B", "option3": "গ) B - A &lt; 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1/B &gt; 1/A", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>AC &gt; BC এবং C &lt; 0<br />বা, AC/C &lt; BC/C<br />বা, A &lt; B<br />বা, 1/A &gt; 1/B<br /><br /></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) -3 &le; x &le; 3 এবং -4 &le; y &le; 4 হলে, নিচের কোনটি x + y এর মান হতে পারে?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) -8", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>-3&nbsp;&le; x&nbsp;&le; 3.......(1)<br />-4&nbsp;&le; y&nbsp;&le; 4.......(2)<br />(1) নং + (2) নং দ্বারা পাই<br />-7 &le; x + y &le; 7</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) x &lt; 0 হলে নিচের কোনটি অবশ্যই ঋণাত্মক?", "option1": "ক) -1/x", "option2": "খ) 1/x<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) -x<sup>3</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 1/x<sup>3</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x &lt; 0<br />&there4; x<sup>3</sup> &lt; 0<br />বা, 1/x<sup>3</sup> &lt; 0</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) x &gt; y, y &gt; z এবং w &gt; x হলে নিচের কোনটি অবশ্যই সত্য?", "option1": "ক) z &lt; w", "option2": "খ) z &gt; x", "option3": "গ) y = w", "option4": "ঘ) 1/w &gt; 1/x", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />w &gt; x, x &gt; y, y &gt; z<br />&there4; w &gt; x &gt; y &gt; z<br />&there4; z &lt; w</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) 0 &lt; x &lt; 1 হলে কোনটি ক্ষুদ্রতম?", "option1": "ক) x", "option2": "খ) 1/x", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 1/x<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>ধরি,<br />x = 1/2<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> = 1/4,<br />1/x = 2,<br />1/x<sup>2</sup> = 4<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> &lt; x &lt; 1/x &lt; 1/x<sup>2</sup></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) |x - 1/2| &le; 1/3 অসমতার সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) 1 &le; x &le; 5", "option2": "খ) 1/6 &le; x &le; 5/6", "option3": "গ) 1 &lt; x &lt; 5", "option4": "ঘ) 1/6 &lt; x &lt; 5/6", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>|x - 1/2| &le; 1/3<br />বা, -1/3 &le; x - 1/2 &le; 1/3<br />বা, -1/3 + 1/2 &le; x &le; 1/3 + 1/2<br />বা, 1/6 &le; x &le; 5/6</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 2 &lt; 0 অসমতার সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -2 &lt; x &lt; 1", "option2": "খ) -2 &le; x &le;1", "option3": "গ) -2 &lt; x &lt; 1", "option4": "ঘ) 1 &le; x &le;2", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + x - 2 &lt; 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - x - 2 &lt; 0<br />বা, x(x + 2) - 1 (x + 2) &lt; 0<br />(x + 2)(x - 1) &lt; 0<br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2508-17.png\" /><br />সংখ্যারেখা থেকে পাই<br />-2 &lt; x &lt; 1<br /><br />লাইভ পরীক্ষার প্রশ্নে অপশন ক) ও গ) একই রকম হওয়ায় উত্তর বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) 1/|x - 1| &ge; 1/2 হলে সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) [-1, 3]", "option2": "খ) [-1, 1) &cup; (0, 3]", "option3": "গ) [1, -3]", "option4": "ঘ) [-1, 1) &cup; (1, 3]", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>1/|x - 1|&nbsp;&ge; 1/2<br />বা, |x - 1| &le; 2; [x - 1 &ne; 0]<br />বা, -2 &le; x - 1 &le; 2; [x &ne; 1]<br />বা, -2 + 1 &le; x &le; 2 + 1; [x &ne; 1]<br />বা, -1 &le; x &le; 3; [x &ne; 1]</p>\r\n<p>&there4; x = [-1, 1) &cup; (1, 3]</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) x<sup>2</sup> - 5x + 6 &ge; 0 অসমতার সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) x &lt; 2 অথবা x &gt; 3", "option2": "খ) x &le; 2 অথবা x &ge; 3", "option3": "গ) 2 &lt; x &lt; 3", "option4": "ঘ) 2 &le; x &le; 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 5x + 6&nbsp;&ge; 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 2x + 6&nbsp;&ge; 0<br />বা, x(x - 3) - 2(x - 3) &ge; 0<br />(x - 3)(x - 2) &ge; 0<br /><img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2508-19.png'/><br />সরলরেখা থেকে পাই<br />x &le; 2 অথবা x &ge; 3</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) x &lt; 8 এবং 2x - y = 7 হলে নিচের কোনটি অবশ্যই সত্য?", "option1": "ক) x &gt; y", "option2": "খ) y &gt; x", "option3": "গ) x + y &lt; 18", "option4": "ঘ) xy &lt; 0", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x &lt; 8 এবং 2x - y = 7<br />বা, y = 2x - 7 &lt; 16 - 7 = 9<br />&there4; y &lt; 9<br />x + y &lt; 17 &lt; 18</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1440000, "pk": 2508, "is_omr": false, "omr_t